## 9. Add the chatbot to the public website

In your public website layout, import the widget:

```
import CollegeChatbot
  from "./components/website/CollegeChatbot";
```

Render it once, outside the page content:

```
export default function PublicWebsiteLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}) {
  return (
    <>
      <PublicNavigation />
      <main>{children}</main>
      <PublicFooterNavigation />
      <CollegeChatbot />
    </>
  );
}
```

Do not mount multiple chatbot instances in individual pages. The widget should be available throughout the public website.

